{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGLJantzen","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGLJantzen","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGLAction"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jDelta_E_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jDelta_E_eq","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L150-L156","doc":"**`Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(E_i) = qi · Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(K_i) · lowerOp i`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.lowerOp_eq_smul_cartan_mul_jDelta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.lowerOp_eq_smul_cartan_mul_jDelta","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L113-L148","doc":"**`lowerOp i = q · Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(K_i)⁻¹ · Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(E_i)`** for Jantzen's `Δ(E) = E ⊗ 1 + K ⊗ E`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.raiseOp_eq_jDelta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.raiseOp_eq_jDelta","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L104-L111","doc":"**`raiseOp i = Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(F_i)`** for Jantzen's `Δ(F) = F ⊗ K⁻¹ + 1 ⊗ F`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.prod_Ioi_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.prod_Ioi_eq","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L97-L102","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.prod_Iio_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.prod_Iio_eq","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L90-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan_kK_mul_cartan_kap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan_kK_mul_cartan_kap","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L82-L88","doc":"`Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(K_i) · Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(K_i)⁻¹ = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan_mul_cartan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan_mul_cartan","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L73-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.kK_mul_kap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.kK_mul_kap","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L64-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.kK","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.kK","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L60-L62","doc":"The Cartan weight of `K_i = q^{ε_i − ε_{i+1}}`: `q` on `e_i`, `qi` on `e_j`, `1` elsewhere.\nIts pointwise inverse is the tail weight `kap q qi i j` of `QuantumGLAction`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jDelta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jDelta","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L54-L58","doc":"**The iterated coproduct** `Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(A) = Σ_s K^{⊗s} ⊗ A ⊗ B^{⊗(n−s−1)}` for\n`Δ(A) = A ⊗ B + K ⊗ A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jTerm","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLJantzen.lean#L46-L52","doc":"`K` on every site before `s`, `A` at `s`, `B` on every later site. ","signatureChunk":0}]}